        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stephen R. Donaldson, Michael Moorcock\n- Works: The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant, Against All Things Ending, Behold the Man\n- Topics: fantasy, science fiction, mystery\n\nFacts:\n- Michael Moorcock was born on 18 December 1939 and is an English writer primarily known for science fiction and fantasy who has also published literary novels.\n- Stephen Reeder Donaldson was born on May 13, 1947 and is an American fantasy, science fiction, and mystery novelist.\n- Behold the Man is a 1969 science fiction novel by British writer Michael Moorcock.\n- Against All Things Ending is a 2010 fantasy novel by American writer Stephen R. Donaldson.\n- Stephen R. Donaldson is most famous for The Chronicles of Thomas Covenant, a ten-novel fantasy series.",
